{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1361112-insistent-telson-artefact-weapon-beige-elephant-for-epitome","id":1361112,"title":"Insistent Telson (artefact weapon) : Beige Elephant for Epitome","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-01-15T11:22:59-08:00","id":1361112,"title":"Insistent Telson (artefact weapon) : Beige Elephant for Epitome","content":"Well, I ended up being much more productive than I thought would be.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epitome</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1350958-the-ninth-annual-exalted-white-elephant?p=1351035#post1351035\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This looks fun, I'm in!<br /> <br /> Here are some things I'd enjoy in no specific order :<br /> <br /> -Fiction, Art or Homebrew for a new Artifact, especially weapons of the following type : War Fan, Hand Needle, Boots, Baton.</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1FPluqR2Ny5oCzDW2Qdkcl8VRyC1BOV-WKRrGlEnaf_Y/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Insistent Telson</a> An Artefact Hand-Needle</span><br /> <br /> Context: a Telson is the terminal segment of the abdomen in, amongst other animals, scorpions. It is where the stinger is.<br /> <br /> If you're giving this artefact a read, please do feed back to me. I'm happy to hear it, and I whizzed through this relatively fast. I'm posting it sooner rather than later so that I don't forget about it, so I'm not 100% convinced of every Evocation's &quot;Balance&quot; (although that is a weird term to use, given how the weapon might end up getting wielded)<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12692-whybover","name":"Whybover","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-15T12:21:25-08:00","id":1361133,"title":"","content":"I love it, thanks! I do love artifacts with a strong theme/flavor and this one delivers.<br /> <br /> This is possibly the single most Black Claw weapon I have ever seen, which is kinda ironic since it's not compatible with the style, but I can totally see it working with Ebon Shadow and White Veil also.<br /> <br /> For feedback, it's hard to tell at a glance but nothing jumped out to me as imbalanced when I read it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25285-epitome","name":"Epitome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25285_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-15T12:47:12-08:00","id":1361143,"title":"","content":"I'm so glad you liked it!<br /> <br /> I definitely saw it as a very potent White Veil or Evon Shadow style. I would probably let a player who wanted to combine it with Black Claw convince me of its applicability, BUT<br /> <br /> I'll note that the actual ULTIMATE use of this weapon would be to use Black Claw's Table-Turning Betrayal to acquire the Insistent Telson (possibly from the shared foe, possibly from the ally involved), and getting the final evocation using its Special Rules.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12692-whybover","name":"Whybover","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}